    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Click each button and observe how the cart changes. Do they match what the button labels and hints say should happen?\r\n\r\n2. Before you ask AI Tutor, write your best guess: which variable is wrong, and what do you think the bug is?\r\n\r\n3. For each bug you find, share your observation and your guess with the AI and ask for help finding and fixing it.\r\n\r\n4. Fix the code in `script.js` and test again until all five buttons work as expected.",
